## Views Organization

### Module Views (owned by each module)

Each module stores its own views. Views are referenced with the module namespace prefix (`module::`):

```php
// Admin views — inside Modules/{Module}/resources/views/admin/
return view('core::admin.dashboard');           // Modules/Core/resources/views/admin/dashboard.blade.php
return view('settings::admin.edit');            // Modules/Settings/resources/views/admin/edit.blade.php
return view('shop::admin.products.index');      // Modules/Shop/resources/views/admin/products/index.blade.php
return view('shop::admin.categories.index');    // Modules/Shop/resources/views/admin/categories/index.blade.php
return view('order::admin.orders.index');       // Modules/Order/resources/views/admin/orders/index.blade.php
return view('faq::admin.index');               // Modules/Faq/resources/views/admin/index.blade.php
return view('blog::admin.index');              // Modules/Blog/resources/views/admin/index.blade.php

// Frontend views — inside Modules/{Module}/resources/views/frontend/
return view('core::frontend.home');            // Modules/Core/resources/views/frontend/home.blade.php
return view('shop::frontend.product');         // Modules/Shop/resources/views/frontend/product.blade.php
return view('order::frontend.checkout');       // Modules/Order/resources/views/frontend/checkout.blade.php
return view('blog::frontend.index');           // Modules/Blog/resources/views/frontend/index.blade.php
return view('page::frontend.page');            // Modules/Page/resources/views/frontend/page.blade.php
```

### Shared Views (centralized in resources/views/)

Shared layouts, partials, and components stay in `resources/views/` and are referenced WITHOUT a namespace prefix:

```blade
{{-- Shared admin layout (resources/views/admin/layouts/app.blade.php) --}}
@extends('admin.layouts.app')

{{-- Shared admin components (resources/views/components/admin/) --}}
@include('components.admin.table', [...])

{{-- Shared frontend layout (resources/views/frontend/layouts/app.blade.php) --}}
@extends('frontend.layouts.app')

{{-- Shared frontend partials (resources/views/frontend/partials/) --}}
@include('frontend.partials.navbar')
```

### Within-Module Includes

When a module view includes another view from the SAME module, use the module namespace:

```blade
{{-- In Modules/Faq/resources/views/admin/create.blade.php --}}
@include('faq::admin.form')

{{-- In Modules/Blog/resources/views/admin/edit.blade.php --}}
@include('blog::admin.form')
```

