## CSS Organization

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `public/css/core/tailwind.css` | Compiled Tailwind — the main stylesheet |
| `public/css/core/brand.css` | CSS variables for brand colors (generated from DB settings) |
| `public/css/core/rtl.css` | RTL overrides for Arabic layout (select arrows, padding flips) |
| `public/css/frontend/animations.css` | Scroll-triggered animations, fade-ins, slide-ups |
| `public/css/frontend/components.css` | Frontend-specific component styles |
| `public/css/frontend/maintenance.css` | Maintenance mode page styling |
| `public/css/admin/admin.css` | Admin panel custom styles |
| `resources/css/app.css` | Vite entry point for CSS bundling |

**When adding new CSS:**
- Admin styles → `public/css/admin/admin.css`
- RTL fixes → `public/css/core/rtl.css`
- Brand/color variables → `public/css/core/brand.css`
- Frontend page-specific → `public/css/frontend/` (new file or existing)
- Animations → `public/css/frontend/animations.css`

