## Routes Organization

`routes/web.php` is minimal — it only loads `auth.php`. All other routes live in their modules:

| Module Route File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `routes/auth.php` | Auth routes (login, register, password reset) — Laravel Breeze |
| `Modules/Core/routes/web.php` | `/`, `/sitemap.xml`, `/dashboard`, `/announcement-dismiss`, `/home-popup-dismiss` |
| `Modules/Core/routes/admin.php` | Admin: dashboard |
| `Modules/Settings/routes/web.php` | `/locale/{locale}` |
| `Modules/Settings/routes/admin.php` | Admin: settings, frontend settings, translations |
| `Modules/User/routes/web.php` | `/account`, `/account/orders/*`, `/profile` |
| `Modules/User/routes/admin.php` | Admin: user management |
| `Modules/Shop/routes/web.php` | `/categories`, `/products/*`, `/search`, `/wishlist`, `/account/order-review` |
| `Modules/Shop/routes/admin.php` | Admin: categories, products, variants, reviews |
| `Modules/Order/routes/web.php` | `/checkout`, `/order-confirmed/*`, `/account/billing-addresses` |
| `Modules/Order/routes/admin.php` | Admin: orders, export, shipping |
| `Modules/Payment/routes/admin.php` | Admin: payments, approval, rejection |
| `Modules/Contact/routes/web.php` | `/contact` |
| `Modules/Contact/routes/admin.php` | Admin: contact messages |
| `Modules/Cart/routes/web.php` | `/cart` |
| `Modules/Testimonial/routes/admin.php` | Admin: testimonials |
| `Modules/Newsletter/routes/web.php` | `/newsletter` (POST) |
| `Modules/Newsletter/routes/admin.php` | Admin: newsletter subscribers |
| `Modules/Blog/routes/web.php` | `/blog`, `/blog/{slug}` |
| `Modules/Blog/routes/admin.php` | Admin: blog posts |
| `Modules/Page/routes/web.php` | `/about`, `/page/{slug}` |
| `Modules/Page/routes/admin.php` | Admin: page content |
| `Modules/Faq/routes/admin.php` | Admin: FAQs |

All `admin.php` route files are loaded with `prefix('admin')`, `name('admin.')`, and `['web', 'auth', 'verified', 'is_admin']` middleware.

